# A stationary bike seen from the side, facing right: a heavy flywheel up
# front, a dark steel frame, a saddle and bull-horn bars with a small console.
# Two tiles wide. The rider sits on the left tile and plays exercise-cycle;
# the saddle, bars and crank housing sit where that pose's hips, hands and
# feet land. zbias -1 paints the whole bike under the rider, since the feet
# carry their own pedals and nothing on the bike has to cross in front.
sprite gym-bike
size 32 30
layer object
footprint 2 1
origin 0 14
zbias -1
tag bike exercise gym
spot cycle 0 0 right exercise sit

frame default
